WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:02,650
this is your home

2
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:05,490
If you don't mind, come in and sit down.

3
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,140
This is my sister Chen Tingting

4
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,620
Tingting’s name is Mr. Zhang

5
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:14,740
Hello Mr. Zhang

6
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:16,880
Just call me sister

7
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:18,240
The exam is about to take place

8
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:20,920
Where are your parents?

9
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:23,570
All passed away

10
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:26,690
My dad has been gone for several years

11
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:31,940
My mother just passed away a few days ago. I'm sorry. It's okay.

12
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,750
My mother left the day after my brother came back.

13
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,540
He started working as a security guard when he was eighteen years old

14
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:46,480
After ten years of being Mr. Zhang, let’s go, sister.

15
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:48,000
Nutritional supplements for senior high school students

16
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,400
Buy whatever you want to eat

17
00:00:49,830 --> 00:00:51,830
No, no, no, Tingting

18
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:53,860
Return the money to Mr. Zhang

19
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:55,710
The money is not for you

20
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:56,910
none of your business

21
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:58,710
Mr. Zhang, I understand.

22
00:00:58,910 --> 00:01:00,070
Can't take money

23
00:01:00,190 --> 00:01:01,190
She is not yet an adult

24
00:01:01,430 --> 00:01:02,830
We can't let her get used to being pitied

25
00:01:04,390 --> 00:01:06,190
Poor people cannot bend their backs

26
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:08,100
It's late. Go back.

27
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:09,020
I'll wait for you in the car

28
00:01:09,260 --> 00:01:10,420
your sister said

29
00:01:10,420 --> 00:01:11,820
You have been a security officer for ten years

30
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:19,870
Why did you come back and get fired? Why did you do something wrong?

31
00:01:20,150 --> 00:01:21,110
So he was fired

32
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:24,690
Are you at home?
